Package: BiocGenerics
Type: Package
Title: Test-Harness Shim for Bioconductor's BiocGenerics
Version: 0.1.0
Description: >
  A deliberately minimal stand-in for the Bioconductor package of the same name, used only
  by the parity generators in tests/parity. Upstream CellChat calls exactly one function
  from it, BiocGenerics::as.data.frame, and only in a code path where its input is already
  a data.frame -- so the call is a no-op coercion. Reproducing it requires no Bioconductor.
  Nothing in r-core or in the cellchatrs package depends on this.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
